<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a turning</i> or <i>change</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπαία, ἡ̓.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for defeat</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπαῖά τ᾽ ἐχθρῶν καὶ πόλει
				σωτήρια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάγια</span>)
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				402
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς Τ.,</span> as <i>giver of
				victory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				143
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				303
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				867
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1028.27
			</span></i>; hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήσαιεν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζηνὶ τροπαῖον ἕδος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.2717
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>causing rout, appalling,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἕκτορος ὄμμασι τροπαῖοι,</span> i. e.
				<i>terrible</i> to the eyes of Hector, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				469
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1174
			</span></i>.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπαιον.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
